  "summary_en": "Israel's State Comptroller audits national AI preparedness (2018–2024), finding no integrating government body, no approved national AI program, falling international rankings, and partial implementation of the Telem program budgets for infrastructure, Hebrew/Arabic language models and human capital. It recommends strong ministerial leadership and Prime Minister/NSC monitoring.",
